        "edit": "Replace the condition `if(s!=0)` with `if(s)` in the combinational always block so the mux selects a when s is high and b when s is low, matching the oracle behavior.",
        "lens_id": "generic_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module mux21(a,b,s,y);\n\tinput a,b,s;\n\toutput y;\n\treg y;\n\talways @(a,b,s)\n\t\tif(s) y=a;\n\t\telse y=b;\nendmodule",
